    % `; memorable` (language.md §2.4): the rules ask "is X a business entity"
    % hundreds of times with the same X in one query; its proof, a cascade of
    % negations over the entity's other classifications, is computed once per
    % query and replayed — the tests of this program run about three times faster.
    *a business entity* is a business entity; memorable.
    *a service* is a service; scenario element.
    *an executive appointment* is an executive appointment in *a business entity*.
    *a business entity* provides *a service*; scenario element.
