    *a legal practitioner* accepts *an executive appointment* as a representative; scenario element.
    it is prohibited for *a law practice* to be involved in *a second law practice*; scenario element.
    *a globe* is a globe.
    *a jurisdiction* is a jurisdiction.
    *an executive appointment* is an executive appointment in law practice *a law practice*; scenario element.
    *a position* is an executive directorship; scenario element.
    *a position* is an independent directorship; scenario element.
    *a position* is associated with *a business*; unknown.
    *a position* is in the law practice *a business entity*; scenario element.
    *a thing* is a trade; scenario element.
    *a thing* is a calling; scenario element.
    *an entity* is an entity.
    *a thing* is a company; scenario element.
