scenario materialinterference is, as stated in the Blawx project at test MaterialInterference:
    % Our expectation was that if being the CEO of megacorp
    % interferes with a lawyer's primary occupation, it will
    % not be permitted under section 34.1 because of 34.1.b.i
    % If we wrap the "according to" in "not", and run the
    % query again, we get an explanation for why the above
    % query failed. It fails because there is no evidence that
    % being the CEO of MegaCorp is associated with widget sales.
    % In our facts, we said that a position materially interfered, but the
    % rule states that the interference needs to come from a "business".
    ceo_megaCorp materially interferes with the primary occupation of jason.
    the primary occupation of jason is practicing_as_a_lawyer.
    materialinterference expects answers [].

